[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11340.59, "timestamp": "03:09:00", "text": "ボスが昇格するのを待つ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11350.99, "timestamp": "03:09:10", "text": "[拍手]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11354.429, "timestamp": "03:09:14", "text": "推測。こんにちは。私たちはボスを待って"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11356.429, "timestamp": "03:09:16", "text": "再生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.55, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "えっと、1分。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11362.95, "timestamp": "03:09:22", "text": "でも、60時間かかるんですよね？幾つか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11371.59, "timestamp": "03:09:31", "text": "それ？そして、私はただ眠るだけです。二。ということで３つ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11374.79, "timestamp": "03:09:34", "text": "4、5、6。待って。 ３、４、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11377.71, "timestamp": "03:09:37", "text": "5、6。あと4人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.83, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "でも登った後には、きっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11385.71, "timestamp": "03:09:45", "text": "もっとやるべきことがある、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11389.55, "timestamp": "03:09:49", "text": "男。これらはどうでしょうか？えーと武器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.75, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "それなら、これらをやらなければならないかもしれません。いいえ、これらは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11396.91, "timestamp": "03:09:56", "text": "武器のようなもの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11398.429, "timestamp": "03:09:58", "text": "[音楽]"}]